  "text": "*ANNEXURE - 08*\n*APPROVED STATION / SOURCE WISE POWER PURCHASE COST FOR FY2019-20*\nచంద్రబాబు దిగిపోయే ముందు ఏపీ ఎలక్ట్రిసిటీ రెగ్యులేటరీ కమిషన్ (ఏపీఈఆర్సీ) ట్యారిఫ్ల జాబితా, విండ్ పవర్ యూనిట్ ధర\nరూ.4.63, సోలార్ పవర్ రూ.5.90లకు ఇచ్చేలా ఒప్పందం. వీటితో పోలిస్తే సెకీతో వైయస్సార్ సీపీ రూ2.49కే ఒప్పందం చేసుకుంది.\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">S.<br/>No.</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Generating Station / Stage</th>\n<th colspan=\"3\">Variable<br/>Cost<br/>(Rs. /<br/>KWH)</th>\n<th colspan=\"3\">FIXED COST<br/>(Rs.Kr.)</th>\n<th colspan=\"4\">Total Power Purchase<br/>Cost (Rs.Cr.)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>EPDCL</th>\n<th>SPDCL</th>\n<th>SPDCLL</th>\n<th>STATE</th>\n<th>EPDCL</th>\n<th>SPDCL</th>\n<th>SPDCLL</th>\n<th>STATE</th>\n<th>EPDCL</th>\n<th>SPDCL</th>\n<th>STATE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Swap Power (Receipts)</td>\n<td>4.00</td>\n<td>203.56</td>\n<td>390.44</td>\n<td>594.00</td>\n<td>0.00</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>81.43</td>\n<td>156.17</td>\n<td>237.60</td>\n<td>4.00</td>\n<td>4.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>NCE - NCL Energy Ltd.</td>\n<td>1.79</td>\n<td>4.41</td>\n<td>8.45</td>\n<td>12.86</td>\n<td>0.00</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0.79</td>\n<td>1.51</td>\n<td>2.30</td>\n<td>1.79</td>\n<td>1.79</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>NCE - Mini Hydel</td>\n<td>2.44</td>\n<td>137.39</td>\n<td>263.51</td>\n<td>400.89</td>\n<td>0.00</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>33.52</td>\n<td>64.30</td>\n<td>97.82</td>\n<td>2.44</td>\n<td>2.44</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>NCE- Solar Parks</td>\n<td>4.10</td>\n<td>1654.49</td>\n<td>3173.28</td>\n<td>4827.81</td>\n<td>0.00</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>4.10</td>\n<td>4.10</td>",
